    "implementation_delta": "Publish AccelerateSignedTagsAndArtifacts@1, DatasetsSignedTagsAndArtifacts@1, KitSignedTagsAndArtifacts@1, and PlatformSignedTagsAndArtifactsCatalog@1. Each component publishes a declared_signed_tag_policy (intended annotated tags ipfs_accelerate_py-v0.0.45, ipfs_datasets_py-v0.2.0, ipfs_kit_py-v0.3.0) and a declared_artifact_checksum_manifest of committed PCPR-053/054 lock text, SBOM, and provenance bytes. Live GPG/SSH git tags, cosign/minisign/in-toto signatures, published wheel/sdist/container identities, and tag protection stay typed unavailable. Signatures and unpublished artifact hashes were not invented. gpg and ssh-keygen are present on the sealed PATH; that is not a live signing identity. No git tag was created or pushed. Mutable origin/main is not the release identity. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
